      "cooked": "<p>No would ever expect team nature to have any foes.</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-241-creative-process-the-naturalist-akashthriya-foes\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-241-creative-process-the-naturalist-akashthriya-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-241-creative-process-the-naturalist-akashthriya-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #241 - Creative Process: The Naturalist &amp;...</a></h3>\n\n  <p>Let's get natural! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:58:14 We have a variety of ideas for foes, and we don't even explore all the ideas we mention! That fine — this episode ended up coming in on the long side, anyway.  You asked us a bunch of questions!...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
