      "created_at": "2023-03-07T23:12:11.332Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was thinking of an Akash foe, some kind of organization opposing her, but A&amp;C brought up a good point that such a thing would have been an Argent Adept thing, first. I was thinking of something like the Hunters from Gargoyles, a secret group/family that carries a grudge for almost a thousand years, that the heroes were largely unaware of.</p>",
