      "username": "Thunderbird",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2023-03-09T01:37:41.346Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"2\" data-topic=\"29918\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I’m sorry, Mister and Miss Abyss? Have we heard these names before? The heck??</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Must be friends with Busybody. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/man_shrugging/2.png?v=12\" title=\":man_shrugging:t2:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":man_shrugging:t2:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/grey_question.png?v=12\" title=\":grey_question:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grey_question:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>Speaking of reusing names, I stumbled upon another instance as a result of the Ashen Heir’s reveal in the <em>Definitive Edition: Disparation</em> video. She was named way back in Episode 67, May 2018. Her teammate on that version of the Freedom Five is <strong>Apex</strong>! No, not <em>that</em> Apex - this was the heroic Moris Dugal (a.k.a. main universe Bugbear). Apex the Wolf-King wasn’t named til Episode 159, November 2020.</p>\n<p><em>Insert Comic Book Guy image here</em></p>",
